	(text "915 MHz trap at U4's input, as on the Beetle V2 (its LoRa radio sends at 902-928 MHz):\nL23 + C79 short the line to ground at 915 MHz (about 20 dB); C80 cancels what they leave at 1176 MHz.\nPlace all three at the diplexer side of C66, each ground with its own via."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 121.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0d406558-d27c-592b-889b-55debfb56715")
	)
	(text "Antenna match (pi network): C81 - C20 - C82, as on\nthe Beetle V2. Tuning positions, left unfitted:\na 50 ohm antenna on J1 needs none."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
